# The entrance spirit (GatekeeperSpirit) of the Seven Signs dungeons: a member of the cabal that owns the Seal of Avarice but loses gets the spirit's own chat window.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/gatekeeper_spirit_owner_losing.golden
character Pilgrim 40
cabal dawn avarice
festival 0 100
sealowner avarice dawn
script script.teleport.GatekeeperSpirit
page gatekeeper/31111.htm
page script/teleport/GatekeeperSpirit/
npc spirit 31111 DungeonGatekeeper 10 0 0

action spirit
action spirit
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=spirit item=0 page=gatekeeper/31111.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
